        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He ! Kaguangh David khuang khou gaanmei gaanphiu,",
            "Nang ramthan gaimei tei nang rui damlou e;",
            "Ai neihlamei mundui tei chakhuan kumna,",
            "Theihmei duipaeng khou nang zanta thuan bamni.",
            "",
            "He ! kaguangh tuna nang zan thuankuni,",
            "Kapumna nang dammei guai tei le;",
            "Kaguangh thuankumei khuan tei kau o,",
            "Kandimei neihla ngam kandiu khang.",
            "",
            "2. Mei guanh makpui hu khou tei kaguangh Jisu:",
            "Kazei luangkei khang ‘za maknga keilou the;",
            "Pa thaina thailou lapui tuang e theimu,",
            "Kandi hei lunghgeihmei makna khaengni e.",
            "",
            "3. Kaguangh khou tei cho bam khang damlou mei tei,",
            "Daniel kumna aini tipma dingni e;",
            "Kachaek gaimei tei le kazan ‘thukmei tei,",
            "Rianra mei teini ryan rana ai suini.",
            "",
            "4. He ! Immanuel kandi kathan dammei,",
            "Kasaan kadiat riat louna tuang khuan theimu;",
            "Rianra akhaeng na tat maan ngam kanmei guai,",
            "Kau kagun daihpui ram khou kalun houni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
